   "extras": {
    "edit_note": "Placeholder \u9b5a\u5e02\u5834 on a quay 1.5 m over the water (the 320 x 96 m reserve), laid out in WORLD numbers round the ROADS island_site_access owns (the 2 + 2 truck ramp, its foot junction, the yard's one-way lane loop -- read at build time): keep paving, walls and props off their bands. The quay wall matches island_reshape.MARKET_QUAY's z 808 edge, the \u7269\u63da\u5834 MARKET_LANDING (0.5 m lower), the east retaining wall MARKET_YARD's x 608 and the strip's 4.1 m. Origin = the reserve's centre on the yard; the quay at -Y. The mesh is the collider; every stair is real steps with a HULL_stair_ slide over its nosings."
